    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d557">

                <pb facs="0687" n="585" sameAs="frus:frus1908/pg585"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Belgian Minister to the Secretary of
                    State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of Belgium</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1908-10-01"><hi rendition="#italic">October 1,
                        1908</hi></date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 652.]</seg></opener>
                <p>Mr. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Secretary of State</hi>: I have the honor to
                    transmit herewith to your excellency a copy of a pamphlet entitled “Belgique et
                    Kongo” published by the Federation for the defense of Belgian interests
                    abroad.</p>
                <p>The publication includes: <list>
                        <label>1.</label>
                        <item>The text of the treaty for the cession of the Independent State of the
                            Kongo to Belgium and the text of the additional treaty.</item>
                        <label>2.</label>
                        <item>The speeches delivered on the occasion of the discussion of the treaty
                            in the Belgian Chamber by Mr. Schollaert, minister of the interior, and
                            Mr. Renkin, minister of justice.</item>
                    </list></p>
                <p>The pamphlet is accompanied by a résumé setting forth the most interesting points
                    in the two speeches.</p>
                <p>Accept, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Bn. Moncheur.</hi></signed></closer>



                <xi:include href="d557-a1.xml" xpointer="d557-a1"/>
            </div>
